msgid "Core polarization potentials"
msgstr "核极化势"

msgid "Input options"
msgstr "输入选项"

msgid ""
"The calculation of core-polarization matrix elements is invoked by the CPP "
"card, which can be called at an arbitrary position in the MOLPRO input, "
"provided the usual AO integrals have been calculated before. The CPP card "
"can have the following formats:"
msgstr ""
"核极化矩阵元的计算由 CPP 卡片调用，该卡片可以在 MOLPRO 输入中的任意位置调用，前提是通常的 AO 积分在此之前已经计算完成。CPP "
"卡片可以具有以下格式："

msgid "CPP,INIT,\\ *ncentres*;"
msgstr "CPP,INIT,\\ *ncentres*;"

msgid "CPP,ADD[,\\ *factor*];"
msgstr "CPP,ADD[,\\ *factor*];"

msgid "CPP,AE[,\\ *record.file*];"
msgstr "CPP,AE[,\\ *record.file*];"

msgid "CPP,SET[,\\ *fcpp*];"
msgstr "CPP,SET[,\\ *fcpp*];"

msgid "CPP,INIT,\\ :math:`<ncentres>`;"
msgstr "CPP,INIT,\\ :math:`<ncentres>`;"

msgid ""
"abs(:math:`<ncentres>`) further cards will be read in the following format:"
msgstr "将读取 abs(:math:`<ncentres>`) 张后续卡片，格式如下："

msgid ""
":math:`<atomtype>,<ntype>,<\\alpha_d>,<\\alpha_q>,<\\beta_d>,<cutoff>,<q_{eff}`;"
msgstr ""
":math:`<atomtype>,<ntype>,<\\alpha_d>,<\\alpha_q>,<\\beta_d>,<cutoff>,<q_{eff}`;"

msgid "CPP,ADD,\\ :math:`<factor>`;"
msgstr "CPP,ADD,\\ :math:`<factor>`;"

msgid ""
"With this variant, previously calculated matrix elements of the polarization"
" matrix can be added with the variable factor :math:`<factor>` (default: "
":math:`<factor>` = 1) to the :math:`h_0`-matrix as well as to the two-"
"electron integrals. In particular, CPP,ADD,-1.; can be used to retrieve the "
"integrals without the polarization contribution."
msgstr ""
"使用此变体，可以将先前计算的极化矩阵的矩阵元以可变因子 :math:`<factor>`\\ （默认值：\\ :math:`<factor>` = "
"1）添加到 :math:`h_0` 矩阵以及双电子积分中。特别是，CPP,ADD,-1.; 可用于获取不含极化贡献的积分。"

msgid "CPP,AE,\\ :math:`<record.file>`;"
msgstr "CPP,AE,\\ :math:`<record.file>`;"

msgid ""
"This is equivalent to the CPP,ADD command (with factor 1), but additionally "
"sets a flag that CPP integrals projected with respect to core orbitals "
"should be used. The projection is necessary whenever explicitly treated "
"polarizable cores are present. The core orbitals are taken from "
"*record.file*, and the CPP,AE command should be followed by a *core* card "
"specifying the numbers of these orbitals in the various irreducible "
"representations. Currently, the code assumes that the polarizable cores are "
"spherically symmetric."
msgstr ""
"这等同于 CPP,ADD 命令（因子为 1），但额外设置一个标志，表示应使用相对于芯轨道投影的 CPP "
"积分。当存在显式处理的极化芯时，投影是必要的。芯轨道取自 *record.file*\\ ，并且 CPP,AE 命令后应跟随一个 *core* "
"卡片，指定这些轨道在各个不可约表示中的数量。目前，代码假定极化芯是球对称的。"

msgid "CPP,SET,\\ :math:`<fcpp>`;"
msgstr "CPP,SET,\\ :math:`<fcpp>`;"

msgid ""
"normally not necessary but may be used to tell MOLPRO after a restart, with "
"what factor the polarization integrals are effective at the moment. "
"Currently the CPP integrals are restricted to basis functions up to and "
"including angular momentum 4, i.e. g functions."
msgstr ""
"通常不需要，但可用于在重启后告知 MOLPRO 当前极化积分以何种因子生效。目前 CPP 积分仅限于角动量 4 及以下的基函数，即 g 函数。"

msgid "Example for ECP/CPP"
msgstr "ECP/CPP 示例"

msgid "Example for use of CPP in all-electron calculations"
msgstr "全电子计算中使用 CPP 的示例"

msgid ""
":math:`<atomtype>` specifies an atomic centre with polarizable core, "
":math:`<ntype>` fixes the form of the cutoff-function (choose 1 for "
"Fuentealba/Stoll and 2 for Mueller/Meyer); :math:`<\\alpha_d>` is the static"
" dipole polarizability, :math:`<\\alpha_q>` is the static quadrupole "
"polarizability, :math:`<\\beta_d>` is the first non-adiabatic correction to "
"the dipole polarizability, :math:`<cutoff>` is the exponential parameter of "
"the cutoff-function, and :math:`<q_{eff}` is the effective charge of the "
"core with which it polarizes its surroundings (only needed if it contributes"
" orbitals to the CPP core (see below)). When :math:`<ncentres>` is lower "
"than zero, only CPP integrals are calculated and saved in record 1490.1. "
"Otherwise, the :math:`h_0` matrix (records 1200.1 and 1210.1) and the two-"
"electron-integrals (record 1300.1) will be modified."
msgstr ""
":math:`<atomtype>` 指定具有可极化核心的原子中心，\\ :math:`<ntype>` "
"确定截断函数的形式（Fuentealba/Stoll 选择 1，Mueller/Meyer 选择 2）；\\ :math:`<\\alpha_d>` "
"是静态偶极极化率，\\ :math:`<\\alpha_q>` 是静态四极极化率，\\ :math:`<\\beta_d>` "
"是偶极极化率的一阶非绝热修正，\\ :math:`<cutoff>` 是截断函数的指数参数，\\ :math:`<q_{eff}` "
"是核心的有效电荷，核心用它极化其周围环境（仅当它向 CPP 核心贡献轨道时才需要（见下文））。当 :math:`<ncentres>` 小于零时，只计算"
" CPP 积分并保存到记录 1490.1 中。否则，\\ :math:`h_0` 矩阵（记录 1200.1 和 1210.1）以及双电子积分（记录 "
"1300.1）将被修改。"

msgid "examples/na2_ecp_cpp.inp"
msgstr "examples/na2_ecp_cpp.inp"

